{"id": "08", "model": "eleven_v4", "lines": [{"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Your mom was the best fighter. Your granny was the richest player. [pause] Your dad was everyone's favorite."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "[quietly] And you... were just \"the son.\""}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[angry] This is MY game! My friends! My server! [pause] You're taking EVERYTHING!"}, {"speaker": "MOM", "text": "[surprised, soft] Sweetie..."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[shouting] I wish you never joined!"}, {"speaker": "MOM", "text": "[quietly] Maybe we pushed too hard."}, {"speaker": "GRANDMA", "text": "[softly] Go talk to him, dear. [pause] Not you. [pause] Him."}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[softly] Hey, champ. [pause] Can I tell you something?"}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[softly] I don't care about the game. [pause] I don't know how to jump. I don't even know what a \"noob\" is."}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[softly, sincere] You've been in that world for a whole year... [pause] and I just wanted to see it. With you."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[quietly] ...You could've just asked."}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[small laugh] I did. [pause] You said, \"Not now, Dad.\" [pause] About two hundred times."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "And then... at eleven p.m.... the alarm went off."}, {"speaker": "SYSTEM", "text": "[booming, alarm] Warning! The Block King has awakened! [pause] If the server falls... everything resets!"}], "voice_segments": [{"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 0.0, "end_time_seconds": 8.0, "character_start_index": 0, "character_end_index": 108, "dialogue_input_index": 0}, {"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 8.0, "end_time_seconds": 10.4, "character_start_index": 108, "character_end_index": 149, "dialogue_input_index": 1}, {"voice_id": "TX3LPaxmHKxFdv7VOQHJ", "start_time_seconds": 10.4, "end_time_seconds": 16.0, "character_start_index": 149, "character_end_index": 230, "dialogue_input_index": 2